@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Parsing reset-plan
participant "mishMash:MishMash" as App
participant "parser:Parser" as Parser
participant "reset:ResetPlanCommand" as Reset
App -> Parser : parseCommand("reset-plan")
Parser -> Parser : parseResetPlan("")
Parser -> Parser : require blank arguments
create Reset
Parser -> Reset : new ResetPlanCommand(activeMealPlan)
activate Reset
Reset --> Parser : command
deactivate Reset
Parser --> App : reset command
note over Parser, Reset
 Keeps the shared holder.
 Parsing changes no session data.
end note

@enduml
'@@author
